      "author": "@pierregoldman7288",
      "text": "What are the secret code to makenyou answer better than you currently do like. /human /el10 /10think\n\nThere are no real “secret codes” like /human, /el10, /10think that unlock a better model response.\nMost of those are internet prompt myths. They sometimes work only because they tell the model what style you want, not because they activate hidden modes.\nWhat actually improves answers is giving clearer operating instructions.\nUse this instead:\nAnswer like a blunt expert. \nDo not flatter me. \nSeparate facts, assumptions, and opinions. \nIf something is weak, say why. \nGive the practical next step, not theory. \nUse examples. \nIf you are uncertain, say “I don’t know” and explain what would confirm it.😂😂😂😂",
      "likes": 3
